<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 Thessalonika</book>
  <para style="h">1 Thessalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Thessalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thessalonika</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Thessalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silvanus leh Timothi in, Pa Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist a um Thessalonika hattuomte kungah, i Pa uh Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist a kipat hepina leh hamuonna na kung uah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thungetna ua na min uh lou in, noute zousie ziehin Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Pasian leh Pa uh masangah, na ginna nasepte uh, itna a nasepgimnate u’leh i Mangpa Jesu Khrist a kinepna zieh a na hakatnate uh ka manghil sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Unau deitahte aw, Pasian tel na hina uh ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen ka khantanhoi uh, thu guoh a na kung ua hing tung ahi sih a, silbawltheina leh Hagau Siengthou leh theichienna lienpi toh hing tung ahi zaw a, noute ziehin na lah ua mibangchibang ka hi uoi chi na thei bang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh hasatna nasatah thuoh pum in, Hagau Siengthou a kipah kawm in thu na pom ua, koute leh Mangpa zuite na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Masidonia gam leh Akaia gam a gingtute zousie dingin etton ding na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen noute akipat in Mangpa thu athangdohta a, Masidonia gam leh Akaia gam guoh ah hilouin, mun chin ah Pasian lam a na gindan uh athangta hi, Tuachi’n kouten bangma ka gen uh angai nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangchibanga na lah ua hing lut ka hi uoi, chi leh Pasian hing leh dihtah be dinga milimte akipat a Pasian lam a na hing kihei dan bang uh amaute mama in agen ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh a tapa mishi lah a kipat a akaitho, lungthahna hing tung ding lah a kipat a hing hundohpa van akipat a hing pei ding na ngah dingin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, na lah ua kang lutna uh aguohsuoh sih chi noute mama in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh na theisa mabangun masanglai a Philippi khuo a zumhuoi tah a bawlsiet a ka um nua un buoi pumpum in, Pasian khantanhoi na kung ua gen dingin ka Pasian uah ka hangsan zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hing hanthawnnate uh zuouthu ahiei, asienglou ahiei, ahisihleh solbawlna a hing pawt zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian phatsah a khantanhoi kem dinga ngansie mi ka hi bang ngei un, mihing lungkimna dingin thu ka gen sih ua, ka lungtang uh enchienpa Pasian lungkimsah sawm in thu ka gen zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na theisa mabangun bangmachihin maitangphatna kam leh deigawna kam mal ka zang ngai sih uhi; Pasian ahing theipipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khrist sawltahte ka hi zieh un noute tungah ngetna bawl thei hinan u’leng, mihinga kipat leh noute akipat ahisihleh midangte tungah zong pahtawina ka sui ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh nu in atate hawmthawtah a don a akep bangin na lah uah lungnem tahin ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka it leh ngaitahte uh na hing hitah ziehun, noute hing ngaina mama in Pasian khantanhoi hing hil guoh lungkim khoplou in, ka hinna nangawn uh hing pieh ka ut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unaute aw ka sepgim dan u’leh ka sepnasat dan uh na theizing uhi, na lah ua koima ka suhbuoi louna dingun sun leh zan a semgim in, Pasian khantanhoi noute ka hing hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nou gingtute lah a, siengthoutah leh dihtah leh genbanglou a ka gamtat dan uh ahing theipite na hi uh, tualeh Pasian zong ang theipipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pa in tate tunga abawl bangin noute ka hing hanthawn ua, ka hing hamuon ua, tualeh ka hing hil ua, na tung ua ka bawldante uh na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aleenggam leh athupina sunga, noute hing hanlutpa Pasian mi hitaah a na um theina ding uh ka dei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami ziehin Pasian kungah tawplou in kipahthu ka gen uhi, aziehpen koute akipata Pasian thu na zah ua na pom laiun, mihing thu banga pomlouin, nou gingtute a zong nasahtah a nasemthei Pasian thu bangin na pom zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unaute aw, Khrist Jesu a um Judia gam a Pasian hattuomte umdan zuimite na hi ua, amauten Judate lah a athuoh bangun, nouten zong na gammite uh lah ah na thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua Judaten Mangpa Jesu leh aguolneite athat ua, koute zong ahing bawlsie uhi, tualeh Pasian asulungkim sih ua, mizousie adou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hundam ahi theina ding ua Jentelte lah a thugen ahing khaam ua, tam bangin akhelna uh a sudim ngitnget uhi, hinanleh Pasian lungthahna khu nasatah in ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Unaute aw, koute pen hun tomkhat sung lungtangah hilou in tahsa a kikhen a i um zieh un, kilawptah a na meel uh mu dingin ka hapan semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kung ua hing pei ka ut uhi, Kei Paul mama in zong nivei zen hinghaw ka tumta hi, hinanleh setan in ahing dal leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen ka kinepna u’leh, ka kipahna uh, ahisihleh ka kipahna manglukhu uh bang ahiei? Ahing pei chienga i Mangpa Jesu mai ah noute mama na hisih ding uh a mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noute pen ka thupina u’leh ka kipahna uh na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka thuohzou nawnlou bep un Athen khuo ah kouma guoh nuasie in um u’leng hoi dingin ka ngaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n i unaupa uh Timothi Pasian nasempa, Khrist khantanhoi lam a ka seppi uh, noute hing sudet ding leh na ginna lam ua hing hamuon dingin ka hing sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam genthei thuohna zieh a koima akilin louna dingin, tam silte thuoh ding mawng a guot ihi uh chi noute mama in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kung ua ka um lai un, gimthuohnate thuoh ding ihi uh chi ka hing hil masata uhi, tuabang ngei in ahing tungta, chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami ziehin, ka thuoh zou nawnlou bep un, solhatpa’n noute ahing solpua khah dinga, ka sepgimna uh athawn hi khava chi in na gindan uh thei dingin ama ka hing sawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin noute a kipat kou kungah Timothi ahing tunga, na ginna u’leh na hing itna uh, tualeh na hing thei ngitnget ua, kouten ka hing mu nuom mama bangun nouten zong na hing mu nuom mama uh chi, tanchin kipah huoitah ahing puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin unaute aw, ka thuohgimna u’leh ka hasatna zousie uah, na ginna zieh un, na tung uah lungmuong tahin ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin ka hing huoi huoi ta uhi, Mangpa a na dindet phot u’leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I Pasian uh mai ah, noute zieh a ka kipahna zousie zieh un, noute tungthu ah Pasian kung ah bangchi bangin kipah thu ka gen tabep ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na mel uh ka mu theina ding u’leh, na ginna lam ua, na tahsap uh ka hing suhbuchinsah theina dingun sun leh zan in nasatahin thu ka ngen tawntung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin i Pasian leh Pa mama in tualeh Mangpa Jesu Khrist in na kung lam uah hing pui hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh kouten noute kang it bangbang un Mangpa’n noute khat leh khat na ki it tuona u’leh mi zousie na itna uh khangsah semsem hen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n i Mangpa Jesu Khrist amisiengthoute zousie toh ahing pei chieng a, i Pasian leh Pa mai a sienthouna a genbanglou hi dingin na lungtangte uh ahing sukip thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n atawp penin unaute aw, na umdan ding u’leh Pasian na lungkim sah dan dinguh ka kung ua kipata na ziltah mabang ua, na kiningchin semsem na dingun, Mangpa Jesu min in ka hing ngen un, ka hing hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa Jesu tungtawn a thupieh ka hing piehte uh, bang ahiei chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Tami Pasian deilam ahi, na sienthouna dingun, numei pasal kaal a thanghuoina tawpsan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Michin in siengthou tah leh zatat huoitah in ama uh tahsa chiet kepdan athei chiet ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian theilou Jentelte banga huasanna lam a kidehla a um louin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam thu ah koiman aval a gamtain aunaupa tungah silgilou bawl sih heh, Mangpa khu tambang sil bawlte zousie phulapa ahiziehin, kouten zong ka hing vau hil ua, ka hing theisah zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in asienglou dingin eite ahing han sih a, asiengthou dingin ahing han zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam thuhilna nuol mi in, mihing nuol ahi sih a, Hagau Siengthou eite hing pepa nuol ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh unau ki itna lam thu ah gelpieh na ngai sih uhi, ki-ittuo chiet dingin noute mama Pasian hil in na umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Masidonia gam pumpi a, unau um zousie tungah tuabangin na bawlta uhi. Hinanleh unaute aw, tuabanga hing khang semsem dingin kang hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu ka hing pieh bangun, kamtamlou a um in, nouma sepding chiet awlmaw un, tualeh nouma khut mama a sepkhiet ding tum chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachia pulam mite lam a kilawmtah a na um theina ding u’leh, tahsap bangma na nei louna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh unaute aw, kinepna neilou mi dangte banga, na lungkham louna dingun, imute tungtang na theilou uh ka dei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Jesu ashi a, athoukiata chi igintat leh Jesu a imute zong Pasian in Ama toh ahing puikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami Mangpa thuin na kung uah ka gen uh ahi, eite Mangpa hing pei donga, dam a na um nalaite’n imusate i makhel sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa ngei khu kikou aw toh, vansawlsieng tungnung pen aw toh, tualeh pengkul gingtoh van a kipat hing kumsuh ding ahi, tualeh Khrist a shisate athou masa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuazou chiengin ei hinga na um nalaite huikhuo ah Mangpa tuoh dingin amau’toh meipi lah ah lahtouin i um dinga, tuachi’n kumtawn in, Mangpa kungah i umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam thute in kihamuontuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh unaute aw, ahun leh ani lam thu pen na kung ua ka gel akipha maw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa ni khu zan a guta banga hing tung ding ahi chi, noute mama in chientahin na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Muonna leh bitna chia agen laitah un,” numei nauvei bangin manthaina thakhat in atung uah atung dinga, asuohta vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh unaute aw, noute pen tua ni in guta banga hing vabihphawn dingin miel ah na um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na unpi un, vah tate leh sun tate na hi uhi. Eite zan tate ihi sih a miel tate zong ihi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi dangte bangin imu sih vai, pil kiukiau in umzaw va ui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Imute pen zan a imu ahi ua, zu khamten zong zan a akham uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh eite pen sun tate ihi zieh un, ginna leh itna awmphaw silin, hundamna kinepna lukhuh khuin eima kithunun in um vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in eite lungthahna thuoh dingin ahing guot sih a, i Mangpa Jesu Khrist vanga hundamna tang dinga ahing guot ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama khu itaangin ashi a, ikhahlaw in zong i imut in zong Ama toh ihingkhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ziehin na bawlsa mabangun, khat leh khat kihamuon tuo unlen, kisuhat tuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute aw, na lah ua semgimte leh, Mangpa a na lamkaite u’leh noute hing vauhil mite thei dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh anasep zieh ua amaute itna toh ngaisang dingin ka hing ngen uhi. Nouma lah a kituoh tahin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin unaute ka hing hanthawn uhi, danlou banga umte vauhil unlen, lungkete hamuon unlen, hatloute panpi unlen, mi zousie tungah thuohhattahin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koima’n koi gitlouna zong gitlou a thuh lou dingin pilvang un, hinanleh nouma leh mi zousie a dingin sil hoi del zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kipah ngitnget un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tawplou in thum un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sil bangkim ah kipah thu gen un, Tami noute dinga, Khrist a Pasian deilam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hagau sumit sih un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasian thu kigente simmaw sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sil zousie enchien unlen, ahoi pouma tudet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sil hoilou a kilangte apat kihemkhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuin hamuonna Pasian mamain noute hing susiengthou bukimta hen, tualeh na lungsim u’leh, na hinna hagau u’leh na tahsa zousie uh i Mangpa Jesu Khrist hing pei chienga, genbanglou dingin humbit in um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Noute hing hanpa aginum a, Aman a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Unaute aw, thu hing nget pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unaute zousie tawp siengthou in ka nousiet uhi hing gen pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam laihah unau siengthoute zousie kungah, hing simpieh dingin, Mangpa min in thu ka hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist hepina na kung uah um hen.
  </para>
</usx>
